      "text": "tools/call — the checks, in order, all fail closed",
      "originalText": "tools/call — the checks, in order, all fail closed",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_ab",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 442,
      "width": 676,
      "height": 208,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 726487214,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2003835131,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  platform key valid, not revoked, scope mcp:invoke\n2  server approved, not quarantined, environment matches\n3  a live grant exists for this subject and this capability\n4  the approved snapshot is the one pinned by the grant (no substitution)\n5  arguments validate against the declared schema\n6  argument rules pass: repo not in the protected set, SQL verb allowed,\n   path inside the allowed root, blast radius under the cap\n7  input scan: no secret or PII leaves in the arguments\n8  rate + concurrency budget for this subject\n9  verified write or irreversible → approval token required\n10 dispatch, then scan the response before it returns to the model",
      "originalText": "1  platform key valid, not revoked, scope mcp:invoke\n2  server approved, not quarantined, environment matches\n3  a live grant exists for this subject and this capability\n4  the approved snapshot is the one pinned by the grant (no substitution)\n5  arguments validate against the declared schema\n6  argument rules pass: repo not in the protected set, SQL verb allowed,\n   path inside the allowed root, blast radius under the cap\n7  input scan: no secret or PII leaves in the arguments\n8  rate + concurrency budget for this subject\n9  verified write or irreversible → approval token required\n10 dispatch, then scan the response before it returns to the model",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    },
